# GitHub auto-requests review from listed owners on any PR that touches
# the matching paths. Currently single-owner (@AminAlAit) — when a second
# reviewer joins, list both with a slash so EITHER can approve.
#
# Order matters: later patterns override earlier ones. Keep specific
# paths AFTER catch-alls so the specific owner wins.

# Default: any change is reviewed by Amin
*                                       @AminAlAit

